    "short_description": "Payhip is a UK-based e-commerce platform founded in 2011, designed for creators to sell digital and physical products directly to their audience. It caters to coaches, writers, entrepreneurs, and other content creators, providing a straightforward way to monetize their work without needing technical skills or upfront costs.\n\nThe platform offers a range of services, including digital downloads, online courses, memberships, coaching services, and physical product sales. Key features include automated payment processing, secure file delivery, VAT and tax automation, and unlimited product listings. Payhip also provides marketing tools, analytics, and third-party integrations, making it a comprehensive solution for creators looking to manage their sales effectively.",
